      "properties": {
        "abstract": "Bee is an Open Source AI Agent platform that is LLM agnostic and comes with a full OSS stack to create no-code agents. In this talk we will give a hands on demonstration of various agents and use cases using Bee. This includes creating new agents and tools live and using them with audience participation. Additionally, we will discuss plans and roadmap for the next 6 months, including showing Bee Hive which extends Bee with multiagency.",
